    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Why Choose Dante Gonzales"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "WHY CHOOSE DANTE GONZALES ORTHODONTICS & OUR 5-STAR-RATED DUBLIN AND TRACY ORTHODONTISTS?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Join The 12,000 Smiles Transformed With Our Dublin and Tracy Orthodontists — Serving Dublin, Tracy, Pleasanton, San Ramon, Danville, Livermore, Castro Valley, San Leandro, Hayward, and Fremont, CA"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Dublin and Tracy Orthodontists With Extensive Experience"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "When it comes to the health and aesthetics of your smile, having experience is key. At Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, we have helped transform over 12,000 smiles in Dublin, Pleasanton, San Ramon, Danville, Livermore, Castro Valley, Tracy, San Leandro, Hayward, and Fremont, California (CA)! Additionally, Dr. Gonzales is a Board Certified orthodontist in Dublin and Tracy, CA. Only 1 out of 5 orthodontists have reached this accomplishment. This experience allows us to properly diagnose your case and expertly recommend the best-suited course of treatment. With Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, you will be smiling brightly in no time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "925-828-2244",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "tel:925-828-2244",
          "text": "925-828-2244"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Advanced Technology"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Our office uses the latest in digital technological advancements. We utilize 3D CBCT x-rays, and 3D models created with the iTero scanners. Our new digital x-ray machines use a very low dose of radiation, and the iTero scanner uses no radiation at all. With this advanced technology Dr. Gonzales will be able to determine the best course of action for your smile journey, whether it be metal braces, ceramic braces, or Invisalign.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Gonzales Guarantee Badge on Orthodontic Treatment"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, we stand behind our treatment for you or your children. For our Premier status patients and VIP Platinum patients are able to get re-treated at no cost for treatment. That’s right, if you don’t like your result, or you forget to wear your retainer and your teeth get crooked, we will re-treat you at no extra charge. This guarantee is just one of the reasons why Dr. Gonzales is different. At Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, we offer a variety of treatment options for straight teeth at our Dublin orthodontic office and Tracy orthodontic office! Click here to call 925-828-2244 to schedule your Gonzales Smile Assessment today!”",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "tel:925-828-2244",
          "text": "925-828-2244"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Hospital Grade Sterilization Standards"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "When it comes to the health and well-being of our patients, Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, a Tom Terry Certified facility, strives to provide a safe, clean, and protected environment. Maintaining the highest level sterilization standard puts our patients at ease and allows them to focus on what’s most important, their braces and orthodontic treatment. Dr. Gonzales ensures a hospital grade sterilized standard for our orthodontics office. The security of your healthy, radiant smile is our top priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Family Discounts On Braces"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Since many families have more than one member who need braces and orthodontic treatment, Dante Gonzales Orthodontics is proud to offer the Family Discount Plan. The more members in your household that receive orthodontic treatment at Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, the more you save! Our Gonzales Smile Assessment is free, so it won’t cost a thing to find out which members of your family will benefit from orthodontic treatment. Click here or call 925-828-2244 to schedule your Gonzales Smile Assessment today!",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "tel:925-828-2244",
          "text": "925-828-2244"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Same Day Starts For Braces"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The process of getting braces and orthodontic treatment is often long. Many patients, like you, anxiously await to receive orthodontic treatment. Dr. Gonzales, our 5-star-rated orthodontist in Dublin and Tracy, CA, offers his patients same day starts for orthodontic care! Get your braces or orthodontic treatment started on your time. We welcome you to explore this option and discuss your preferences with our orthodontist. This unbelievable option is available to you at our Dublin orthodontic office and Tracy orthodontic office!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Same Day Appointments Available At Our Dublin & Tracy Orthodontic Offices"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, you can take comfort in knowing that your orthodontic needs are a priority. We don’t put you on a waiting list for your first appointment, like other orthodontic offices in Dublin and Tracy, CA, may. You won’t have to wait weeks or months just to find out that your transition to a new smile can’t start for several weeks (another waiting list for treatment). Dante Gonzales Orthodontics is happy to get you in the doors the same day you call to make an appointment and even get your braces and orthodontic treatment started as soon as possible (if needed), sometimes even the same day! Click here or call 925-828-2244 to schedule your Gonzales Smile Assessment today!",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "tel:925-828-2244",
          "text": "925-828-2244"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Flexible Hours At Our Dublin & Tracy Orthodontic Offices"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "If you’re like most people, you’re busy! That’s why we offer flexible hours for our patients so that you don’t have to schedule your life around your braces or orthodontic treatment. If you or your child have orthodontic concerns, that can be stressful enough; it’s our job to make sure you’re taken care of at your convenience. Be sure to ask about our flexible hours at your initial appointment. We look forward to seeing you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Flexible Payment Options For Braces & Orthodontic Treatment"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, we know cost can be a big issue when it comes to braces and orthodontic treatment. We want to make braces and orthodontic treatment easy and affordable for you or your loved one to obtain once you walk through the doors of our Dublin orthodontic office or Tracy orthodontic office. We offer many financing options to accommodate your needs. Our orthodontic team will discuss which financing options are available to you during your Gonzales Smile Assessment. Click here or call 925-828-2244 to schedule today!",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "tel:925-828-2244",
          "text": "925-828-2244"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Dublin & Tracy Orthodontic Offices Care For Our Community"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Gonzales Orthodontics was founded with one mission: to make a difference in people’s lives. This guiding mission is carried out in three principles: to change people’s lives, advance our profession, and support our community. We are putting these principles into action not only through our products and services, but also through our involvement in the community. Gonzales Orthodontics is committed to giving back to the people and the community in which we live and work. Listed below, you will find a small sample of the community organizations through which we give back. For the community-minded patient who wishes to make a difference beyond the walls of our office, the choice is clear. At Gonzales Orthodontics, it’s more than just providing braces! We believe passionately in being active participants in the communities in which our patients live. Since the office started in Dublin in 2006, we have contributed over $380,000 to the benefit of our community."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Our Latest Community Donations"
    },
