    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Oral Hygiene Certificate"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Gonzales Orthodontics our primary concern is for the health of our patients’ teeth. Not only do we want our patients’ teeth to be spectacularly straight, we also want them to be clean and cavity free! To encourage and reward our patients for visiting their dentist, we are giving away a Jamba Juice certificate for those patients that return to our office with a signed “Smile Certificate” from their dentist or hygienist. Click here to download and print our certificate. Every time your regular dental cleaning is completed, have your general dentist or hygienist sign the certificate. Then present this signed certificate to the office of Dr. Gonzales to receive your complimentary Jamba Juice certificate."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "5-STAR-RATED ORTHODONTIST IN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "DUBLIN & TRACY CALIFORNIA (CA), FOR BRACES & INVISALIGN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Gonzales and his staff are truly outstanding. They have an excellent manner with children, while being extremely competent and professional. I would feel comfortable recommending their services to anyone."
    },
